    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "6C45367949483D43",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n欢迎你来到圆模道馆。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "6C45357949483B90",
      "text": "与虫相伴甜点师阿枫……\\n要挑战这个道馆馆主吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "6C453879494840A9",
      "text": "那好，我带你去对战场吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "6C45377949483EF6",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n随时都可以告诉我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_entry_01",
      "hash64": "646E2CD7DF034FC2",
      "text": "彩粉蝶，\\n多多～地享用吧～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_poke_entry_01",
      "hash64": "65F00449FA87129F",
      "text": "彩彩～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "873EDBF65FF9575F",
      "text": "哎呀～哎呀～\\n这位出色的训练家～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "873EDCF65FF95912",
      "text": "你滚橄榄\\n滚得太溜了，谢谢～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "873EDDF65FF95AC5",
      "text": "哎呀～\\n我还没介绍自己呢，是吧～？[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "873ED6F65FF94EE0",
      "text": "我是派舒蕾・慕滋的店长阿枫～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "873ED7F65FF95093",
      "text": "哎呀呀～？现在我上的是\\n圆模道馆的班才对呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "873ED8F65FF95246",
      "text": "说错了～说错了～\\n我是道馆馆主阿枫才对呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "873ED9F65FF953F9",
      "text": "平时是个做甜点的\\n甜点师哦～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "873EE2F65FF96344",
      "text": "放入口中就会感到幸福的甜点\\n和藏在草木当中的虫宝可梦，\\r\\n它们都很小，却拥有很大的力量～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "873EE3F65FF964F7",
      "text": "你可要好好加油，\\n不要给我可乘之机哦～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "874260F65FFC6F35",
      "text": "即使是在对战当中，\\n你的实力也在不断膨胀啊～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "87425FF65FFC6D82",
      "text": "我也要完成更～进一步的\\n进化才行呀～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "87425EF65FFC6BCF",
      "text": "我郑重宣布，你合格啦～！\\n这个能证明你战胜道馆馆主的\\r\\n道馆徽章，就请你收下吧～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_16",
      "hash64": "87425AF65FFC6503",
      "text": "阿枫我特制的手工蛋糕\\n也一起多多～地享用吧～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge",
      "hash64": "03E0CD0DB4E5B087",
      "text": "有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个道馆徽章的话，\\n等级[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的宝可梦会更容易捉到，\\r\\n也都会听你的话～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge_all",
      "hash64": "7357E0542B75F0CB",
      "text": "有８个道馆徽章的话，\\n不管是什么样的宝可梦都能捉到，\\r\\n而且它们都会乖乖地听你的话哦～！[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_waza",
      "hash64": "54D7588FA1FEE21D",
      "text": "你吃东西的样子真是好赞，\\n要不要也尝尝招式学习器这个甜点呢～？[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "87425DF65FFC6A1C",
      "text": "在冒险的途中得到的\\n招式学习器以后可以用\\r\\n招式学习器机制造哦～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "87425CF65FFC6869",
      "text": "祝你今后前进的道路\\n充满甘甜与柔顺～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_15",
      "hash64": "87425BF65FFC66B6",
      "text": "那么，\\n我们后会有期～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "6C453A794948440F",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n你突破了圆模道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
